# Client B of the network check: joins a little later than A, spawns its own box and pushes it the
# other way, waits for the world to settle and prints what it sees.
wait 150
assert.net_joined
net.send physics.spawn_box net_b 2 4 0 1
wait 40
net.send physics.push net_b -2 0 0
wait 380
net.bodies
quit
